  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">Your lineage consists of coati’zis aelkhazak, where down feathers and fur coats parts of your body and you have a particularly fluffy tail, all to assist in living in arboreal environments. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Acrobatics checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Qf1ylAbdVi1rkc8M]{Maneuver in Flight} and checks to perform @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.2HJ4yuEFY1Cast4h]{High Jumps} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.JUvAvruz7yRQXfz2]{Long Jumps}. You also gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.LQw0yIMDUJJkq1nD]{Cat Fall} feat, even if you do not meet its requirements.</span></p>"
    },
